### TribalWars Tribes API Tests

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ===== GET TRIBES FOR WORLD =====
### Retrieve list of all tribes from TribalWars (cached for 15 minutes)
### Result is sorted by VillagesCount in descending order
GET {{baseUrl}}/worlds/pl218/tribes
Accept: application/json

### ===== GET TRIBES FROM DIFFERENT WORLD =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/worlds/pl219/tribes
Accept: application/json

### ===== GET TRIBES FROM ANOTHER WORLD =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/worlds/pl220/tribes
Accept: application/json

### Response format for each tribe:
### {
###   "tribalWarsId": 189,
###   "name": "Piekielne Alpaki",
###   "short": "AHA",
###   "villagesCount": 2660
### }

### Notes:
### - World parameter is typed as WorldType enum (pl218, pl219, pl220, pl221, pl222, pl223)
### - Data is cached for 15 minutes per world
### - List is sorted by VillagesCount descending (highest villages first)
### - Player names are automatically URL-decoded from the TribalWars CSV format

